{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51772","headline":"题舫斋（原作詹时泽诗，敦仁字君泽，疑即一人） · 詹敦仁","name":"题舫斋（原作詹时泽诗，敦仁字君泽，疑即一人）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"尖头屋子不嫌低，上有青山下有池。\n一阵东风拂松响，恰如蓬底雨来时。\n（同上二五四○「斋」字韵）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"詹敦仁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51772.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51772","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}